Z||000000||hugh||08-12-2001||07:20 PM||||I started this thread because I am tired of what has been happening on this forum and I didn't want to add to another thread and appear to be supporting any one individual.There is one person who has brought the wrath of quite a few members on himself lately.Edsb52 with his long posts have upset more than a few people.He defends himself by attacking his adversaries.He doesn't have to start anything there are too many members who are more than willing to start something.Some will try to provoke an arguement just for the sake of an arguement.I think he wants it to end,and I surely do!!!There are some members(who shall remain unnamed) that just don't want to let go.I am tired of the bickering,as I am sure many others are.If one member doesn't like another they should ignore them and not try to draw them into an arguement that the rest of the forum is almost forced to watch like the soap operas.Again,I support no one I am just tired of the fighting.   ||||reg||1
