Z||000009||JSocha||08-13-2001||05:27 PM||||I just made it to your post.  Been a long day.<P>Hugh, I couldn't agree with you more and wish it would have stopped much, much sooner.  <P>However, Ed and I have finally been able to call a truce and I have subsequently apologized for my actions to him and the forum and he has done the same with me.  Virtual handshake was exchanged and I am working on buying him a virtual beer in another thread and to work with him.  <P>I'm hoping this is the end of all flame wars, but I realize its not.<P>Email me privately if you please so as not to get an necessary war going again if you wish or wish to share your direct opinion with me as well as feelings.<P>Respectfully yours,<BR>Jeff||||reg||1
