Z||000014||Archie||08-14-2001||12:13 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"><P>Hugh, from what Little Eddie has to say, you and I are in bed together against him. Have you and I ever met? Have we ever exchanged EMail of any kind? Have we ever talked on the phone? I don't really recall, but I don't think so. <P>Little Eddie, there will be no Virtual handshakes here. I recall every other time you've got crap started on this Forum and how you've stated that you were going to cool it twards the ends of those threads. But then you come back a couple weeks later and pull your crap again. you've made a truce with a few of the people you've insulted but in just a couple of weeks you'll be acting the A$$ again. In this thread you've already 2 more enemies for every truce you've made resently. The only way to keep someone like you under control is for someone to keep his foot on your throat, & that will be me.<P>You think that very few of the 2900 members want you to leave, I suggest that the vast majority of the active members have an extreme desire that you leave.<P>We've all seen you insult several members of the Forum and you've even made peace with a couple of them. Well maybe they can forgive (or ignore) your insults. But the rest of us know that you are only a few keystrokes away from another marathon long winded post insulting 4 or 5 new people, like you did above.<P>Now, I go out of my way to avoid your threads and I will continue to do so..... but if you want a war, then you came to the right place.  If you really want peace then act like it. Take your own advice and shut up.<P>BTW, from now on when you see a responce to one of your windy posts that is a simple "thumbs down" that person is trying to tell you something, you should pay attention.<P>Archie||||reg||13
