Z||000017||JohnnyK||08-14-2001||02:11 AM||||"You think that very few of the 2900 members want you to leave, I suggest that the vast majority of the active members have an extreme desire that you leave." - archie<P><BR>Because about 10 people have said it? Hell, only about 2700 of those 2900 people post here anyways. I'm getting sick of the long winded posts too, but your not looking at the facts here. Archie, I don't know you either, but from what I have read, you aren't the most liked person either. Sure, a lot of people love you, but what about the other 2900? Can't you simply ignore it?||||reg||1
