Z||000030||EdsB52||08-15-2001||06:33 AM||||Before I reply to Archie’s idle physical threats, I would like to say that Hugh and I privately communicated and have ironed things out. His intent was to quash the dissension in the forum. In the “Weakest link” thread initiated by Archie, I offered Archie the last shot and walk away; he took three including a threat to put his foot on my throat. Archie continues to insult the origin and opinions of anyone that remotely supports me or simply disagrees with him. Archie, do you dislike Canadians, or just the beautiful country of Canada? In case you act as if you don’t understand I’ll remind you:<P>“I like Chicago much better than Ontario.”<P>Archie, I have no problem with Chicago, but it’s common knowledge that the rate of beautiful cities in Canada is much higher than the rate of beautiful cities in the United States; unless you consider the definition of ‘beautiful’ to be crime galore, overcrowded prisons, and trash all over the place. Ya, capitalism is better than socialism (sorry, just my sarcastic commentary!). Archie posted:<P>" <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Archie:<BR><B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> <P>"Hugh, from what Little Eddie has to say, you and I are in bed together against him. Have you and I ever met? Have we ever exchanged EMail of any kind? Have we ever talked on the phone? I don't really recall, but I don't think so. <P>Little Eddie, there will be no Virtual handshakes here. I recall every other time you've got crap started on this Forum and how you've stated that you were going to cool it twards the ends of those threads. But then you come back a couple weeks later and pull your crap again. you've made a truce with a few of the people you've insulted but in just a couple of weeks you'll be acting the A$$ again. In this thread you've already 2 more enemies for every truce you've made resently. The only way to keep someone like you under control is for someone to keep his foot on your throat, & that will be me.<P>You think that very few of the 2900 members want you to leave, I suggest that the vast majority of the active members have an extreme desire that you leave.<P>We've all seen you insult several members of the Forum and you've even made peace with a couple of them. Well maybe they can forgive (or ignore) your insults. But the rest of us know that you are only a few keystrokes away from another marathon long winded post insulting 4 or 5 new people, like you did above.<P>Now, I go out of my way to avoid your threads and I will continue to do so..... but if you want a war, then you came to the right place.  If you really want peace then act like it. Take your own advice and shut up.<P>BTW, from now on when you see a responce to one of your windy posts that is a simple "thumbs down" that person is trying to tell you something, you should pay attention.<P>Archie</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Archie generated this thread:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002931.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002931.html</A> <BR>"Who's elevator doesn't go all the way to the top?<BR>Who is a couple apples short of a bushel?<P>What Village is missing it's Idiot?<P>******, The votes have been counted & you ARE the Weakest Link...... GOODBYE!!!<P>Please, no marathon posts in this thread, just add your "one liner" and either an "UP" or "DOWN" thumb.<P>Everyone knows what we are voting on.... so remember keep the posts short and mention NO NAMES.<P>Archie"<P>It's obvious to whom he was referring, but he's attempting to hide behind the veil of condescension by pretending it wasn't meant as a libelous post against me. I respond to his ignorance, so then he posts this:<P>"Who's mouth runneth long after you get tired of reading?<BR>Ed, you ARE the Weakest link, in more ways than one!...... GOODByE"<P>No disclaiming to whom he was previously referring. I then tell Archie to get the last shot so we can put this thing to bed. He replies with:<P>"What's wrong Eddie? No one said anything about you in this thread until you came in and threw mud my way. Hmmmmm...... it seems that Little Eddies' feelings get hurt even when you don't mention his name.<BR>You have a lot of room to talk about a showing a little class..... gollie.... you of all people telling someone else to have some class. You the guy who started the "Why Threaten" thread. You the guy who got Cliff so mad that he shut the Forum down.<BR>Yeah, you are a class act alright.<BR>Who is the one who can't let it go?<BR>Who is the one who can dish it out but can't take it?<BR>Who Feels that every thread is all about him?<BR>The votes are what counts & You ARE the Weakest Link.<BR>ROFLMAO at you"<P>I was hoping this would be the last from Archie, but no such luck. Yes Archie, I did start the "Why threaten" thread. The intent and actual outcome of that thread was to non-confrontationally diffuse a cyber-fight that another member and I mutually started; we are now on good terms. I guess you have a problem with that. Archie, being the instigator many of the times, replied with the post that's featured at the top of this post. Archie futilely attempted to make the consensus of the forum believe he was not referring to me when he initiated the 'weakest link' thread. Does anyone here believe that? If so, read this and ask yourself again (8-8-01 @ 11:43pm):<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002892.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002892.html</A> <BR>"Ditto TRiAD, me too!<BR>Let's see, now that's 6/2900.<BR>Anyone else?<BR>Archie<BR>Remove the Weakest Link"<P>Archie has never written that as the bottom of his posts before, as far as I can tell. Like I said when dealing with sjp777 (FieroBritney), simple people leave all kinds of clues everywhere. The simpler the person, the easier the clues are to find. In this case (8-12-01 @ 11:27am) 3 1/2 days.<BR>Even sjp777 went to a little more effort than Archie; he sat in wait for a month and a half. Maybe it's Archie's overblown ego that led him to believe he could pull off such condescension of the forum. I wonder if he condescends his customers the same way? If I were Archie, I would spend more time trying to fix the problem where the water pump allegedly virtually rubs the right rear tire (so I hear) instead of trashing would-be customers in the forum and on the phone. Someone told me that the water pump resides so close to the rear tire that the heat translated from the water pump to the tire actually raises the right-rear tire pressure 3 pounds. Can anyone confirm or refute that?<P>Now I’ll dissect your post filled with threats:<P>“Little Eddie, there will be no Virtual handshakes here. I recall every other time you've got crap started on this Forum and how you've stated that you were going to cool it twards the ends of those threads. But then you come back a couple weeks later and pull your crap again.”<P>Fair enough, no handshake. When did I write I was going to cool it? Post examples, and then post examples of why you think I started the, what you call the subsequent crap. If you have respect for Cliff and this forum, you won’t do anything to relive the dark days. If you don’t research and post, I’ll assume you’re working on that alleged water pump problem like you should be.<P>“you've made a truce with a few of the people you've insulted but in just a couple of weeks you'll be acting the A$$ again.”<P>No, I believe myself and all other members are going to good from here on out. Maybe a new member’s moniker initiated by you will become hostile. But as far as I’m concerned, all members have a clean slate with me and I hope to have one with them, with the exception of you. If any members feel they need to engage me, then they do so on their own volition. If they wish to watch from the sidelines, communicate with other members via private email, or ignore the adverse posts between Archie and I, then I commend them. But Archie wants war, so anyone that jumps in is doing so without prompting from me and shouldn’t complain to anyone about the outcome. Many members seem to place Archie on a platform as some kind of messiah. If he is, let him fight all his own battles, especially the ones where he is prompting. Someone claimed I was biting off more that I could chew by arguing with Archie. If that’s the case, then let the supposed stronger competitor fight alone. Why help the so-called Goliath? Who is anyone serving by defending or supporting the supposed strongest competitor, themselves?  <P>“The only way to keep someone like you under control is for someone to keep his foot on your throat, & that will be me.”<P>This is where you box yourself into a corner. You might contend you’re speaking in metaphors, but this is, in all reality, a legitimate threat. For every day that goes by and you don’t have your foot on my throat, you will appear to the forum as a punk. Who else makes threats and doesn’t either rescind them or follow through?<P>“But the rest of us know that you are only a few keystrokes away from another marathon long winded post insulting 4 or 5 new people, like you did above.”<P>Actually no. The only long winded posts I’ve made, as of late, are ones where I attempt to make peace and they’ve worked.<P>“Now, I go out of my way to avoid your threads and I will continue to do so..... but if you want a war, then you came to the right place.  If you really want peace then act like it. Take your own advice and shut up.”<P>When I said for you to take the last shot and declare it as that, I didn’t mean for you to take three and throw in a physical threat to boot. I knew I had to offer you the last shot, due to your huge ego, but it’s reasonable to assume I didn’t mean for you to make threats. You will respond with something about me not staying away or not holding true to my word of not letting you have the last word. The truth is I did let you have the last shot, then another last shot, but the third last shot where you threatened me needed to be addressed.<P>If everyone’s noticed, Archie has been silent until the last few days when many members and I have made amends. Since then he’s come from nowhere and started all kinds of garbage, or perpetuated what was already started. Archie can’t stand that I have friends in this forum, why is that?<P>“BTW, from now on when you see a response to one of your windy posts that is a simple "thumbs down" that person is trying to tell you something, you should pay attention.”<P>This followed his threat, then his disingenuous agreement for peace (unless I want war, then I came to the right place). He’s laying the groundwork for subtle, cryptic harassment from his supporters, while he expects me to sit here and take it. Anyone believe Archie wants peace?||||reg||1
